{
  "dqlnbVersion": 1,
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Jaffle Shop — Welcome",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Jaffle Shop — Welcome",
    "savedWith": "datalex-cloud"
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Jaffle Shop + DQL\n\nThis workspace adds a DQL governed-analytics layer on top of the standard Jaffle Shop dbt project. The connection points at the dbt-built `jaffle_shop.duckdb`, the dbt DAG is synced, and there are **10 certified blocks** plus a **Jaffle Analytics** App with an executive dashboard.\n\nRun the cells below, open **Blocks**, **Apps**, and **Lineage** in the left rail, then follow [`TUTORIAL.md`](../TUTORIAL.md) for a guided tour and to build your own block."
    },
    {
      "id": "revenue_raw",
      "type": "sql",
      "content": "SELECT date_trunc('month', ordered_at) AS month, SUM(order_total) AS revenue\nFROM dev.orders\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
      "name": "Revenue by month (raw query)"
    },
    {
      "id": "customer_mix",
      "type": "sql",
      "content": "SELECT customer_type, COUNT(*) AS customers, SUM(lifetime_spend) AS lifetime_spend\nFROM customers\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY lifetime_spend DESC",
      "name": "Customer mix"
    }
  ]
}
